name iso-639-3-retirements
# ISO 639-3's retirements: what a retired identifier was called, why it was retired, what it changed to, and when.
match iso-639-3_Retirements.tab
witness SIL Global

tier row by \n
header
tier field by \t

thing row Id
content Id Ref_Name Ret_Reason Change_To Ret_Remedy
omit Effective
attest row Ref_Name Ret_Reason Change_To Ret_Remedy Effective
